# Auto-appointments (Aug 2026)

Do **not** turn unused auto-creates back on without product sign-off. Types stay
in the add-appointment UI for **manual** use. Templates stay in
`reminder_templates` with `is_active = false` — do not delete the rows.

## Auto-create that stays on

- **CS Intro Call** when the client enters Client Services
- **POA Follow Up** is a manual appointment type. Nothing creates it from a delivery scan.

## Off (flags / inactive templates, not deleted)

Stage-entry flags in `lib/reminders/stage-entry-appointments.ts` (`AUTO_CREATE`):
Retention Call, 30/60/90 check-ins.

`CREATE_CASE_SENT_NOTIFY_APPOINTMENT = false` in `lib/clients/case-sent-triggers.ts`.
Client + attorney already get mail when assigned from Attorney Queue
(`case_referred` + portal assignment). Do not recreate a “call the client”
task on stage change.

All `reminder_templates` are inactive, including Cards Charged and the renamed
AM Enrollment Follow-Up (was “7 Day Call”). Re-enable with `is_active = true`
or by flipping the matching flag.

## Notes vs Activity

Appointment creates write `appointment_created` to `audit_log`, not a
communications note. Do not restore “Appointment scheduled:” notes.
